# What the server image must not carry.
#
# The PDFs alone are ~50 MB and nothing but the offline importer reads them; bin and obj from the
# host are the wrong platform's output and would be copied over the container's own.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/

docs/
tests/
tools/
web/

.git/
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
